{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-09T03:28:56Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T16:39:58Z","closed_at":"2026-02-11T16:39:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.4.1.stable, 4.5.1.stable, 4.6.stable, 4.7.dev [56f3e2611daadb0b1894b46737ee3000e82e33f9]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (56f3e2611) - Fedora Linux 43 (Forty Three) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Single-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (RADV GFX1201) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 60.39 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using Jolt Physics, and leaving the `total_mass` property of a `SoftBody3D` at its default value, the `SoftBody3D` will increase in actual mass by 1 kg for every point in the mesh, greatly affecting its interactions with `RigidBody3D` objects of reasonable mass.\n\nSetting the `total_mass` property to any other value will stop it from increasing in mass, but will instead result in it behaving increasingly erratic as the subdivisions increase (and the per-point mass decreases), which is tracked separately in #116058.\n\nNote that the default value of `total_mass` is (as of writing this) 0.001 kg, when it \"should\" be 0 kg instead, due to #116050. Also note that this is purely what the inspector says it is. The default value will always be treated as 0 in the Jolt physics server, regardless of what the inspector says. I talk a bit about the questionable reasons for why the 0 kg default value was chosen [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111993#issuecomment-3864596572).\n\nIdeally the default mass should be 1 kg instead, just like Godot Physics, and should not scale with the increase in subdivisions.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP.\n2. Run the main scene.\n3. Note how the soft bodies more easily push over the 100 kg box as they increase in subdivisions.\n4. Switch to Godot Physics.\n5. Note how they barely affect the box at all to begin with, and don't increase in effect as subdivisions increase.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[soft_body_default_mass.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25172916/soft_body_default_mass.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116076/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116076/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}